Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.47,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}眼前則是俗套的情境
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.84,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}我們與彼此攜手作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:32.06,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}化學反應恰逢其時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.72,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}抬起曾低下的頭
