Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:30.86,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}難以抑制的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:33.60,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}熱血與孤獨淪為一片漆黑
